1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
Two sign traps.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:07,578
Writing delta H equals eight ninety for burning methane loses the mark.

3
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:11,067
Heat is released, so it is minus eight ninety.

4
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:20,078
And an exothermic reaction has a negative delta H, yet the thermometer rises, because the thermometer is in the surroundings, which gain the heat.

